  the parameterised-resources decision above to settle first)
- completion/complete for prompt arguments — a SEPARATE capability,
  not part of `prompts`, and already out of scope for this phase
- pagination of prompts/list (cursor / nextCursor)
- 2026-07-28-draft-only fields: title, icons, resultType, ttlMs,
